dmin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-07-22T16:25:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T16:14:01Z","closed_at":"2026-07-30T16:14:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.7.1.stable\n- In 4.6.2.stable, the issue is not present.\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 15.7.5 - Godot 4.7.1.stable - Metal 3.2 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M1 Max (Apple7)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn a [previous issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120457), I mentioned an issue with directional shadow map culling for orthogonal camera. Even if the [fix](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120711) merged for 4.7.1 seems to solve *most* of the issue, we still noticed issues within our game. So I decided to take the same test scene again, change a few parameters (camera near plane), and I could witness an issue of the same kind (don't know if it is exactly the same issue). Note that on 4.7.0, the shadows are much more broken.\n\nThe scene is a collection of small cubes projecting their shadow on a plane.\nHere is what the shadows look like in 4.6:\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"495\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/625ba225-1459-442d-9729-c15d6e375ec6\" />\n\nAnd in 4.7.1:\n<img width=\"755\" height=\"468\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a715dcca-5769-41c5-8384-c7185837f675\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee the \"Minimal reproduction project\".\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is the project used to demonstrate the issue : [shadow_cull_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30276250/shadow_cull_mrp.zip).\n\nJust open the project and the camera should be in orthogonal mode and correctly positioned to witness the issue.\n\nThis file is the project used on the https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678 pull request.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121644/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121644/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}